note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note apps/omega-chrono/gate_chrono.om: Pure seeded OM-2 Verification Gate for Wave 2 alien-chrono.
note
note Modes:
note   gate_chrono                              Run in-process end-to-end checks + >=7 negative controls
note   gate_chrono OMC_BIN REPO_ROOT SCRATCH    Verify omc pin SHA-256, 2x deterministic compilation of
note                                            chrono_forge.om, live CLI runs, disk W^X & OTKJ & MEMO
note                                            artifacts, >=7 negative controls, and 3 source mutants
note   gate_chrono --rwx                        Refused fail-closed with exit code 2
note
note Zero C, zero Python, zero Rust, zero hardware GPU writes (hw_writes=0).

